<h2>Asobi Review 0.2 (build 455)</h2>
<p><b>Exported voice notes follow the playhead.</b></p>
<ul>
<li><b>Fixed: voice notes in exported QuickTimes froze on the wrong frame.</b> The export held on the frame where you <i>pressed record</i>, not the frame you were talking about — so a note where the playhead moved while you spoke landed short by however far you'd travelled.</li>
<li>The picture now follows your playhead exactly as it does when you play the note back in the app: if you scrubbed while talking, the export scrubs with you and ends where you ended. Notes recorded on a still frame freeze as before, and subtitles are unchanged.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
